    # Derive-Secret, Extract-Early/Handshake/Master, per-direction
    # derive_keys, finished_key derivation. RFC 8448 §3 byte-identical
    # vectors for SHA-256 path (early_secret = 33ad0a1c..., empty SHA-256
    # = e3b0c442..., Derive-Secret(early, "derived", "") = 6f2615a1...).
    # SHA-384 early_secret (7ee8206f...). Per-suite (key, iv) sizing.
    # Finished-key HMAC verify_data round-trip + tamper rejection. 16
    # checks total. Same compile/link/run pipeline as tls_record:smoke.
    var compiler = compiler_path()
